{"video_id":"k-wDhfu2juk","language":"asr-en","transcript":[{"text":"Now, active traders like myself, we","start":0.0,"duration":4.4},{"text":"don't really rely on fundamental","start":2.16,"duration":4.92},{"text":"analysis because in the short term, the","start":4.4,"duration":5.84},{"text":"price can get extremely disconnected","start":7.08,"duration":5.16},{"text":"from the fundamentals due to the","start":10.24,"duration":4.48},{"text":"emotions in the market of fear and","start":12.24,"duration":5.28},{"text":"greed. As active traders, our job is to","start":14.72,"duration":5.6},{"text":"capitalize on those emotions without","start":17.52,"duration":5.52},{"text":"falling victim to them ourselves. We do","start":20.32,"duration":5.52},{"text":"this by performing technical analysis.","start":23.04,"duration":5.36},{"text":"So, technical analysis is the universal","start":25.84,"duration":4.76},{"text":"language of the financial market and","start":28.4,"duration":5.44},{"text":"it's displayed in the actual candlestick","start":30.6,"duration":7.84},{"text":"charts that we use every single day.","start":33.84,"duration":4.6}],"metadata":{"title":"The Importance of Technical Analysis","author_name":"Ross Cameron - Warrior Trading","author_url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBayuhgYpKNbhJxfExYkPfA","thumbnail_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/k-wDhfu2juk/sddefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEoCIAFEOAD8quKqQMcGADwAQH4AbYIgAKAD4oCDAgAEAEYWiByKBEwDw==&rs=AOn4CLDBn33DH5MzM206gfe2VShJM_YiBg"},"length_seconds":37,"lengthText":"0:37"}